data: {"id": "913bd1b9563d4b6b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1867", "run_id": "913bd1b9563d4b6b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，证据已经非常清楚了。让我总结一下：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期状态（Prometheus Metrics）\n- `kube_pod_status_phase` 确认 Pod 当前处于 **Pending** 阶段（值为1），其他阶段（Running、Succeeded、Failed、Unknown）均为0。\n- 无等待容器、无重启记录。\n\n### 2. Pod 事件（kubectl describe）\n- **关键事件**：`FailedScheduling`，持续 36 分钟，反复出现。\n- **具体原因**：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`。\n- 所有 3 个节点都因为**不匹配 Pod 的节点亲和性/选择器**而无法调度。\n\n### 3. Pod YAML 规格\n- **Node-Selector**: `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`\n- **Tolerations**: 仅容忍 `node.kube", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789037773331, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

